{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1441,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de4b622dae3fce8a188987a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还没发威呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f25e30b4642336051bfebdeafef8a55e0860aa5c04447fef4b24511e7da80a83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81384d528df4488f909a4640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟敢瞧不起我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05bb5e542d2f9c1f50ec73d135cd380c956bcd039a889473ea6167983089104",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5042cc8dc879ea5de2e548f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！被老子的强大吓到了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "716a8b5cf00e2e83abee3b66b02b5839539c26ed937f246b64ade18aa891ddb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c8957bd070fa8bd694e5884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！怎么样，把全员都干碎了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf568b7d5c545876b36ccd371073e6f1bc4710db18f089a82ff54d9b0b976485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d83b60df33a5984ef1a19a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走起，噢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67618eeb57a00af8891f79102867d74031a814414349e580733a42d84e61b21d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca18fd9f1cd73ec01382f48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别瞧不起人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0e30014f36dce58f36c56e0dec59a163551105971ceb44555206e4e007d4da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce86ca8ca9632a5f8206e34c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，“消音器”借到了！\r\n这样在宿舍练习也不会被富士瞪了。\r\n看我的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d923c7042eaf319af646ec16cfface5330d5835def9a66b5fb8a546cb6248c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2414512cc4c1ea398eb4a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞧不起我可是会吃苦头的！\r\n把你们全打爆，统统打成小鸡仔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c99ed8c4cde33dbec1251150f449941244e38b8070102bf4d9ae57936ee60d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895a99b842a8933c0b019fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "合照也拍了……一应给老妈寄过去吧。\r\n嘿！是不是好哥们儿我可不知道！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c6f15dde91dcdf03805dce4254682d000f27ec401fca729bcf38b122554120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:678c31fd931a16afd54a6b54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务？\r\n嘿！轻轻松松吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a415be11e479d37738bde866a2da44a21eb86663fd2236b2c4fee4c47dc589ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa09d5f022783d5dc93d9e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，没忘带东西吧？\r\n要是弄乱了会给景致增加工作的吧。\r\n好好带齐了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "250f4155f24ebd5b2a9b4ea45690f4946b79e92b7176ec940faf4477b5ec9bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88f09caf17b2f5aa1eb0e17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你们见识一下，我的一人舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2971b0446b32132b8bfbb48ed1c294714ad3a84945fc1d15c114a2d4b796149c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87891dbc1baabf89d8fa559b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让全场的家伙们都被吓尿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46ed65048fc89bb9e6ed12d9b91b7c0a8dc417c7683f9c7c521ca3e92deade2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdce5fc5183b4be293773fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，给老子冲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "977752200d82455f3ad8f366ae3e3dbe9398c3305237d01be110ed86b574e1ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1d285420ef7cf15790baa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老子可是特意把你这种菜鸟捡回来的，\r\n感激涕零吧！拿出全力跟上我的强大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b23ae4c1ea1b9d93c58a8503fbf139a978c5a8bcd3644f6ea82b7b7383dcde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7524f6955fef0174247366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把蝴蝶结做大一点的话，威慑力会更强吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ed0d816fb957dadd1f9b9f2d8104d418b0e6ae770321d06b05dc565655b2e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e364c1ed7cdb66ae9c3ba3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕穿同样的衣服，我也要成为最显眼的那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0faf4fc2e8714c0ddffcd74d5768e6ed66c399c2dbbccd71d0c7d896530f4b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee4e30076d350419c5133c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件红夹克，很酷吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28614e2ed3f8b81cdf9d02527b0f03224abe5e383bdb4046ca6b596d325eb54b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:255f4ff23d43de8feef06996",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿得随便一点，风纪委员就开始唠叨……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d954ce179532476b10a42c43fc0de179576636b4fa2d05ee5c18d1365ab29c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04f6b7c7f6e499889ee71fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live练习什么的轻轻松松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb9a8344febf2bc808165ee9dd705a287107e233935ff9f53c3c5d207bc9832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311f5f1909cd97c79ebfc948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防寒措施已经完美得不得了了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25d7a0f5d7c141764c36de73b17c1415d58f8070c2bafa4d94e4e4a7d8f4bcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:611b007a9a1a64c539d3629a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得从穿搭上就开始威慑才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "191cf769500c9343f9f23c4e35815d55e8e79eb525826e2a90e037a4cad67865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da92dd5e47a98f68fdb0dc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干嘛，有意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8743203f7cd8c3a41f90ef3b8766e209854644e779e08f488afb07dc93f35b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e26ef6c2bd2f0cd1e5d5bd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鞋子就是要够硬才行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48920d73669372ef653c9ac229064d2c87ccc64f6bcbd7d5ca840af24ba74972",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c1618eb389fe98ff88fe35d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙，糖果库存快没了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed3f915e3fc60070ef9bc6c3b260f7b83c8d8701a5a6efb43e9b1745062eb2d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd74b206d4c736dbba73cc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把蝴蝶结做大一点的话，威慑力会更强吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ed0d816fb957dadd1f9b9f2d8104d418b0e6ae770321d06b05dc565655b2e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6091a60b15239642bf2ebbe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕穿同样的衣服，我也要成为最显眼的那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0faf4fc2e8714c0ddffcd74d5768e6ed66c399c2dbbccd71d0c7d896530f4b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1922aa94fa287e337abe59c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件红夹克，很酷吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28614e2ed3f8b81cdf9d02527b0f03224abe5e383bdb4046ca6b596d325eb54b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91fa77d08f522e1a3736aeff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿得随便一点，风纪委员就开始唠叨……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d954ce179532476b10a42c43fc0de179576636b4fa2d05ee5c18d1365ab29c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971e06594c5ba1aa6f064612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live练习什么的轻轻松松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb9a8344febf2bc808165ee9dd705a287107e233935ff9f53c3c5d207bc9832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e2952c125192936cb9af77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防寒措施已经完美得不得了了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25d7a0f5d7c141764c36de73b17c1415d58f8070c2bafa4d94e4e4a7d8f4bcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78f2f51c187dfa8cf2d4d3ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得从穿搭上就开始威慑才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "191cf769500c9343f9f23c4e35815d55e8e79eb525826e2a90e037a4cad67865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c48d86514d9b1e5ec01915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干嘛，有意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8743203f7cd8c3a41f90ef3b8766e209854644e779e08f488afb07dc93f35b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a38aac6c65b2c9d20f42bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦",
      "source_fingerprint": "15de4cfdbbe960272e9799fc4d59a88b779ceabf2455ac702990e6576f9cd128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76dc518f18bc354004cadef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——啊！？我早起有什么奇怪的！\r\n从小就养成了早睡的习惯，没办法啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d209ef35cf09d6d586730884ceb9b8e10b0d5b9085d027dcbc1d1e19237bac2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d16a7ef139a1b36963c8092",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……早。\r\n——干嘛，有意见吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf3847153f53ba6898c371cc9d9cfae46e1fb41c54a7cda856d212133908e70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0e409471b1d49929142c47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊？你午饭又随便对付？\r\n明明还教训我要注意营养。店要关了，赶紧去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32f469a282674d242737f2af5b8aeba7ed349c22349cf78eb8eb11506cbc804b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e0fca9489e5a9f4c2eaa66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "困的时候就把糖果咬碎啊，\r\n嘎嘣嘎嘣的！我一次能咬碎三个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1e54347011c8597d5a69e71c6ff7f70ea0819174f5cbaba37f9514f171747e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43fa3f604957da7f3e44a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈呼……——哈！\r\n才、才不困呢！\r\n老子通宵也轻轻松松！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e821e0c1c1b9c23114d837c96f112b6cd909ef44d09528a7d9308ca74181a58a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:834bed0cff778f01c24a2fbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直不可理喻……宿舍厕所灯快灭了\r\n这太给人添麻烦了吧！？没别的意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c3038761e0677bd4df51a3a47be0225bff22b83225721bb5a8fd1022d42907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e48de24ba7145c019dfd4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的草地青青的很酷啊……\r\n沙地也搞个花坛什么的……？\r\n呀，踩到花会很不爽吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b38541f54a6d9f7e375d1036320d89dd2c865788ceb11dc5181b7de277b48e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50401164a17d20612bf35751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "车站前的梨子芭菲确实好吃……\r\n但那芙莉欧索一脸得意的表情……！\r\n老子才不会向船桥屈服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a35d81762081abd449d7932babd334880a934f180dc0105481eb475185b88ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed64d38aace86a2180df361b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋冬的新款外套哪里都没货啊……\r\n可恶，只能找训练员做交易了吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad76c0011530a83c934ae2ee8db4673f8e6fd77f7bd912483dd35b0cd1508a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9e73a099bfa1374627bf1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷什么的，别怂啊！\r\n老子刚才还在外面吃了冰激凌呢，\r\n呵……哈、哈嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d53b23287562e5256af8c0b85f7c02f714bfe5073bf709e0a3f5c0fab73502e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fedc805402119c22b140f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……情人节……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b04425715dba7055fb13165722fa9f8f00f490d16b41dbc01ad4df60822776e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15122fa0f6e8c42200305e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏那家伙，把我当乖孩子对待\r\n搬东西只是因为看她太慢了受不了而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13857038d302b356d5cdc5d041894a18ec993993613459be08d5ba9a2b563725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeea213bf906bc0d6d3abea0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小林立奇，又在说什么风水之类的\r\n把房间重新装修了……。\r\n嘛，挺新鲜的，心情倒是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63fa0067e47aacb85ba580e725eb11f6bcaf6d8abe21ad91160b564b72dcb850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4abb44cf5fc05dfb4ff065ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北港火山送了一一大堆蓝靛果过来\r\n真是的，都说不需要谢礼了。\r\n……嘛，会吃的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3d1970a4eb0571d815173d7af77bd3fd903967702e025bf50c8409ab72f839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:619de4a06167c9dd245f1aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我弟弟考试考了100分哦！\r\n哼哼，怎么样，很强吧。毕竟是我弟弟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c228cae40fad506f233eb3b42c179726e48181177e45e4e32fb53347c847f4f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:853291c040128c1a1a79c63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼——哈——呼——！！啊！？\r\n只是吃了点激辣拉面而已……\r\n怎么了，挺好吃的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ec0bdd13d58a7096b132a979495438b0b46e7942b72750c04616fdcb04cecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e38a5f5639bb74c04eb25c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个，感觉是可爱系的……\r\n看起来一点都不强。嘛，下摆的感觉\r\n……倒还是挺酷的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1e88c864142e22ed8a05ce2f5c6faff027bab3c7a2268de31e97f6fe3bda1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3512630a0b5f681031c214ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昂？编舞和歌都轻轻松松。完美！\r\n太水的演出会被人瞧不起的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "357551c01ab7a51005eb1994eec7aeee15d38fa5e2da88524c75b665e949ed1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4a43c9df6661cd70adb022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！怎么样，\r\n闪瞎眼了吧，吓到了吧！\r\n这可是我浑身解数的胜负服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b66f36671354f57ec8a272326a28e51d94462fd69a211a7ac23fb76be413d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2704a13ca31aaf794f14dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“小跳跳”弄脏了。得赶紧洗……\r\n——哈！不是！是配饰！\r\n要是脏了就很逊吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0c4a6426dd9ce6b14d8960e515a633d318f7fda741fa5d5aa12abc0ba30018",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80d4a0e0266c3d584f43014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早饭什么的我有在吃！不用你说！！\r\n三文鱼、豆腐、味增汁、羊栖菜——你那什么表情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05ae1d438aa484267cd1203e63d5fb9c2b5bf4508d24041d60331c523a88def7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c04f80839a6c6f22a39af63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的。太阳神那家伙真让人费心。\r\n话说她求救的那个课题，不是昨天截止吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f46f35fdc66de6ef1b0210bc66c3090d68938d85787a9fee3d3b3482f973963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7633417ec7d9f7905a713c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！轻轻松松甩掉你们！\r\n做好觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b30e2f95fd21a48d36c117766205de6619ae3b35b9da01b9ec7d1402bcab916c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b717bde80c15ad18f9cdbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是想要金色的“Bling Bling”\r\n挂件啊……晚上也显眼，看起来又强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae3591ff9b591e767f397d280811714ae15a66935fa0bfa98fe2e1454d01cc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bad25247a412468cd2124c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能被新入生瞧不起啊！\r\n被打招呼的时候，我要压低声音\r\n回礼吓吓他们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fae684288d73952f3c2ea04270222c3078a1946b36c667ba84ea7c95023bdfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335b0b143adbe1e9d1f910c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新款刨冰？反正又是奶油加一堆\r\n甜得发腻的东西吧！……嘛，\r\n看在味道的份上？尝尝也不是不行？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0a98fed1702d189f2b0e494005b0dfea65cc28ee929c5d02eb2262741d77293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106375375966fc2b0b985a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天教本什么的也会打折啊……\r\n我要一直守到打骨折的\r\n底价再买爆它们……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f6917343acd02401961ea81770ca98a42667cc2068e9b405cdc34e71c3f43f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397aee9f04e2d73e51bcae10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积雪什么的简直最糟糕了。又滑又硬\r\n摔了可疼了！……才不会摔倒呢！？说我呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8986e9987ab0fca08f70d0d3b2b36133374ddb967ba09954db1d2129a1ac050e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88afc1ea584f0dfc3f7bfd87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，开始了。\r\n要是拿半吊子的任务\r\n糊弄我，老子可不饶你！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1beaea6df9c2d4c05965a77c1af0762a3d86f7c5d58db8376b225004ac339d0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cf894d9de7ff1b7364d1a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备活动早就做完了！\r\n老子才不是那种会在基础的基础\r\n就掉链子的菜鸡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "802b85d32306ec246134c70039f706f943369b42b83e8d321e92f1789d2824cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e6d8fd2556ebe802a371b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶紧开始训练！\r\n要让周围的家伙们看清楚，\r\n最强的是老子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f917580c74896798cf2f671f294b7a34d14894dedd76ca888ba59d7e387e99df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f9740c42084822157f57bd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "管你什么尽管放马过来！\r\n我会完成两倍的训练量给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf342182c8d18bbb72530c63caaad6a11e82bbfe6cb1bb957a97ad4872ec303c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1d509b7428eb44b9b35e1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要做那个训练，老子就能变强了吧\r\n……你要是敢骗我，老子饶不了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c32e27ca09dc298a9fa21115ca55c3d03619191e595fdd0055d3c62913af87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9cc2a68a4c99b0eb3d8d8b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉力量确实变强了……\r\n这是你的工作吧，给我拿出点自信来啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31fdb4180c6b3135232951ead800bf4236c408ec1e79cefb51b083b12c571fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a887baaca10db419b8748b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喂，快出下一个指示。\r\n昂，我是因为认可了你的菜单才听你话的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "450b80b64a4323c7ccc37a206c82e22194c82293b67edbf8b86f4897d8fe23cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a43d6654d9d35cbdac896db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私用的泳衣也带了！黑底加超酷\r\n花纹的那种！毕竟战斗力不能掉啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94737e6d62d3e71dea52b894803b338d19467d042c95ebacdd7e6dc2ed83c33f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975ae108d241f474740d7987",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们简直最强！就这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3374a9abac0c1045039ef6aff8d4f5c29e81800a7348bca63e8710e4a4e89c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc0f58be953c6cc4a3b6ab05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把全员都打脸了！全打成小鸡仔了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "620b21e9c15b65a8e215f4ae237db25424a8ce5481dd67a43e6498b7f360f77c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:469b6ab02aa881506c59ea8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会变得更强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be5eface2aa31a9c591c8e9e94050c19303a0d684c3c410d19bb5290a6458d20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3449c7cc0cf7f333725d0ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别瞧不起人！老子没有极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6957fbfc27afbc18be2b74114f546c3c3c9c787351a94d80e730156b06af003a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a61569507ea5161e5469158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是希望之城啊，噢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3783ec3ad83f7339fd05f9cf1331cffa78bd399b40c540a2be50d7e1f9e2e059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4862136d03233029826a534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别瞧不起人！\r\n要让你们明白老子才是最强的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1df163470c0eb551744f74bb0ab58584aea18d30d080d352b26763ae3a3465",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f946ef817f889cf1c2af586b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，帮帮你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c3be8e8b6feba478ce40d454fc0ebf21820bdabfae875e2583d8805df96a7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21eab1b71d440a1ec74f8814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种程度轻轻松松吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7fb23cbc8596b0d6eea2108db082e84ead40f86556fd5369bb469ef8ecdf90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a86a0cd801480d074fa40c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ときめきを胸に！",
      "source_fingerprint": "372c9338da6689aa9e9d895d5c04453264e6b167b2a8b9a20bf9dfcf3f1710c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd11f78654ef46f203fe297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしが『わたし』を愛せる\r\nように。最高のコーディネートを\r\nこれからも探し続けます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b7ae124e5822ec4fc4c734c13dc1fc90f61a16b4691903a8f444ca89e04b87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
